# Security Standards

- OWASP Top 10 awareness on every feature.
- Password hashing with strong KDF; refresh rotation; rate-limit auth/OTP.
- RBAC on mutating routes; branch scope for staff.
- Webhook signature verification mandatory.
- No PAN/CVV; mask national IDs in logs/UI lists.
- Device locks require authorization + reason; never from unverified payments.
- PDPA-minded retention and access paths for Thailand pilot.
